mark socket 7 0
|.......ff..
|......fhgf.
|..ffffgggff
|.fhgfhfhfgf
|fg.......gf
|f.........f

view L key rest origin 3 2
mark socket 3 0
|..ff.......
|.fhgf......
|ffgggffff..
|fgfhfhfhgf.
|fg.......gf
|f.........f

view L key lie origin 3 2
mark socket 3 0
|..ff.......
|.fhgf......
|ffgggffff..
|fgfhfhfhgf.
|fg.......gf
|f.........f

# (FORGE-HEAD i2) crest yield: drawn only on cone crested sallet; any other alloy helm family wears no ridge crest
view D key rest when alloyshape,!helmfam-cone,!helmfam-crested,!helmfam-sallet replace
|.

view U key rest when alloyshape,!helmfam-cone,!helmfam-crested,!helmfam-sallet replace
|.

view R key rest when alloyshape,!helmfam-cone,!helmfam-crested,!helmfam-sallet replace
|.

view L key rest when alloyshape,!helmfam-cone,!helmfam-crested,!helmfam-sallet replace
|.

view L key lie when alloyshape,!helmfam-cone,!helmfam-crested,!helmfam-sallet replace
|.


# (FORGE-HEAD envelope r1) the T6 winged helm: its fin is the crest; the forge crest steps aside (the Mythic keeps its flame)
view D key rest when helm.t6,!alloyshape,!mythic replace
|.

view L key lie when helm.t6,!alloyshape,!mythic replace
|.

view L key rest when helm.t6,!alloyshape,!mythic replace
|.

view R key rest when helm.t6,!alloyshape,!mythic replace
|.

view U key rest when helm.t6,!alloyshape,!mythic replace
|.
